      "content": "yeah, sounds good. actually i was just looking through the council's budget realignment docs for the next fiscal year. it looks like they're planning to cut costs on the central compute cluster by like 50%... apparently they want to migrate the management tasks over to the Tier-2 lite model once the current contract expires. \n\nhave you seen that in your planning docs yet? i'm curious if you think the lite version can handle the current load.",
